POST /api/campaigns - {"name":"Release 2.8 — audit history","subject":"What is changing in the audit page","lists":["@list:product@"],"type":"regular","content_type":"richtext","from_email":"Elena Petrov <elena@northstar-relay.invalid>","tags":["release","2.8"],"body":"<p>Ship the audit improvements without hiding the remaining export risk.</p><h3>What is changing</h3><ul><li><strong>Correct the audit timezone label.</strong> The timestamp value is correct. The label says UTC after local conversion.</li><li><strong>Approve the audit empty state.</strong> Use the short copy. Do not show an error when a new workspace has no export history.</li></ul><h3>Still being decided</h3><p>Audit page copy is final. Export timeout is the only item that can still change the release date. I need a go or no-go by Monday noon.</p><p>Target date 2026-08-27. Nothing here is final until the go or no-go.</p>"}
POST /api/campaigns - {"name":"Scheduled exports above 50,000 rows","subject":"Scheduled exports stopping at two minutes","lists":["@list:customers@"],"type":"regular","content_type":"richtext","from_email":"Samira Okafor <samira@northstar-relay.invalid>","tags":["support","exports"],"body":"<p>Some scheduled exports above roughly 50,000 rows are stopping at two minutes. Interactive exports of the same data finish.</p><h3>What is happening</h3><p>Lumen reproduced at 52,184 rows. Manual retry uses the account limit; scheduled execution still passes 120 seconds. Test 50k, 75k, and cancellation before merge.</p><h3>What to do today</h3><p>Document manual retry as the temporary path. Do not promise a release date.</p><p>We are testing the fix against larger exports and against cancellation. We will write again when it has passed, and not before.</p>"}
